poll AND with a bit missing: 0x800280E3
poll OR with one bit set: 0x00000000
poll gives the bits: 0x00000003
poll that clears its pattern: 0x00000000
poll gives the bits from before clearing: 0x00000003
clearing the pattern clears only it: 0x00000002
clearing all clears every bit: 0x800280E3
wait times out: 0x80028005
a timed out wait gives the bits: 0x00000004
a second waiter without the multi attribute: 0x800280E2
cancel: 0x00000000
cancel counts the waiting threads: 0x00000001
a canceled wait: 0x80028007
a canceled wait gives the cancel pattern: 0x00000005
delete: 0x00000000
a wait on a deleted flag: 0x80028006
the first of two waiters: 0x00000000
the second of two waiters: 0x00000000
DONE
